# The stored prefs through SDL's own loop: the gear opens the settings panel, and Light and then
# Dark are picked in its Appearance toggle, each written as it applies (src/settings.odin). tools/run
# loop runs it twice on one --prefs directory: the second run reads what the first wrote. Positions
# at 1440 x 900 from the reference's DOM: the gear (1363, 28, 40 x 40), the toggle's options 91.33 x
# 34 from (1113, 112); the panel's opening runs 643 ms.
size 1440 900
density 2
wait 800
click 1383 48
wait 700
click 1251 129
wait 300
click 1343 129
wait 300
